    {
      "id": "claim_45b7cb8dc9ec425a830efd757adee13d",
      "statement": "`hteam login` prompts for or accepts `sessionid` and `csrftoken`, probes the live boards list through a temporary authenticated `HteamClient`, and refuses to write local config when the auth probe returns unauthorized or fails with a network error.",
