    {
      "id": "claim_8e81179f0ff94f55ba1515e5c2f2f262",
      "statement": "After a successful auth probe, login resolves the default board by precedence: explicit `--board`, still-visible configured board, single visible board, otherwise manual selection or no board when the account exposes multiple boards or none.",
