      "id": "claim_3a345331e4e34360a6fee2fc40497c14",
      "statement": "The login command prints a success message after a valid auth probe, but when board resolution yields `NeedsSwitch` or `NoneAvailable` it skips board persistence and asks the user to switch manually; when resolution yields `NotFound`, it still saves the cookies and then fails with a missing-board message.",
